 "transcript": [
  "[action] The second son is busy with his grain market.",
  "[action] sets up grain market",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) asks eldest son",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now what is the meaning of all this running about and being busy from dawn till night? You are my son and I am your father and you should stay at home with me.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son stands proudly, looking at his father with disdain.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and he is a son and you are his father and he is right and you are wrong. In a house the father sits at home and the sons go out in the world and make money. That is how it is in all houses.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, but I have no son who is a son and I do not know what to do with this one.\"",
  "[says] The eldest son responds to his father with disdain.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I suppose I am not good enough for you and I suppose I am a fool and I suppose I am a man and I can do what I like with my own life.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung weeps and asks his eldest son to forgive him.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Forgive your old father and forgive his weak heart. I am an old man and I have loved you more than all the sons in the world and now I am old and foolish and I do not know what to do except weep.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son enters his father's inner court and sits beside his father.",
  "[action] The eldest son puts his arm around his father's shoulders.",
  "[action] The sons enter their father's inner court and sit beside him.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now what have I done to you two sons of mine except that I have loved you more than all the sons in the world?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son weeps silently.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and you have not loved us enough,\"",
  "[says] The eldest son answers in a cold tone.",
  "[action] The eldest son stands and looks at his father with cold eyes.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son looks at his father with anger."
